# title: Best-of call
# category: Multi-asset
# underlyings: 3
# source: Stulz, Options on the Minimum or the Maximum of Two Risky Assets, Journal of Financial Economics, 1982
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A call on the best performer of three stocks: expensive, and worth more the less the stocks move together.
# param: notional = 1000 | amount | Notional
# param: strike = 1.0 | percent | Strike on the best performance

2027-01-04
    notional = 1000
    strike = 1.0
    s0 = spot(0)
    s1 = spot(1)
    s2 = spot(2)

2028-01-04
    best = max(spot(0) / s0, max(spot(1) / s1, spot(2) / s2))
    pays notional * max(best - strike, 0)
